## Auth Architecture

```
Landing page → Clerk-free, zero friction
  → Free Context Hub analysis (unauthenticated)
  → Brand Profile reveal
  → Click locked feature → GateModal
      → FORGEFRIEND / EARLYBIRD / SANDBOX100 (promo)
        OR PayPal $99
      → is_paid = true
      → if signed in: reload → useActiveBrand → gate drops
      → if not signed in: localStorage brand_id → Clerk sign-up → auto-tether → gate drops
```

**Key Decisions:**
- `ClerkProvider` wraps `BrowserRouter` — single instance
- `requireAuth` guards protected endpoints, `softAuth` for public routes
- `clerk_user_id` on `brand_profiles` — auto-tethered on `/api/auth/me`
- `useActiveBrand` waits for `isLoaded`, re-fires on `isSignedIn` change
- `AppContext.isPaid` wired from `useActiveBrand.isPaid`

**Clerk URLs:**
- Sign in: https://accounts.forgeintelligence.ai/sign-in
- Sign up: https://accounts.forgeintelligence.ai/sign-up
- JWKS: https://clerk.forgeintelligence.ai/.well-known/jwks.json

**Promo Codes:** `FORGEFRIEND` · `EARLYBIRD` · `SANDBOX100` (unlimited)

**Dev Reset:** `POST /api/admin/reset-brand-paid` with `{ brandProfileId, adminPassword: "ForgeCanvas" }`

